[{"t0": 17.24, "t1": 444.06, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The user wants a complete website for a French bakery called \"Le Petit Four\" with:\n1. Hero section with name and tagline\n2. Menu with at least 6 products and prices in euros\n3. Opening hours\n4. Contact form (name, email, message) with thank-you message without page reload\n5. Responsive (desktop and mobile)\n6. No external resources (no CDN, no web fonts, no external images)\n7. CSS and JS can be inline or in separate files\n\nI'll create a single index.html with embedded CSS and JavaScript to keep it simple, or I could create separate files. Let me create a beautiful, complete bakery website.\n"}, {"t0": 22.26, "t1": 444.06, "kind": "text", "text": "I'll create a beautiful, complete bakery website with all the requested features. Let me build it as a single `index.html` with embedded CSS and JavaScript.\n\n"}, {"t0": 23.63, "t1": 444.07, "kind": "tool", "tool": "write", "args": {"path": "index.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Le Petit Four — Boulangerie Pâtisserie Artisanale</title>\n  <style>\n    /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html {\n      scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;\n      color: #3b2f2f;\n      background: #fdfaf6;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    img {\n      display: block;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    a {\n      color: inherit;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== NAVBAR ===== */\n    .navbar {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      z-index: 1000;\n      background: rgba(253, 250, 246, 0.95);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ddd0;\n      transition: box-shadow 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .navbar.scrolled {\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(59, 47, 47, 0.08);\n    }\n\n    .navbar-inner {\n      max-width: 1200px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-brand {\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      color: #8b5e3c;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-links {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 2rem;\n      list-style: none;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-links a {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #5a4a42;\n      transition: color 0.3s;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-links a::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: -4px;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 0;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: #8b5e3c;\n      transition: width 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-links a:hover {\n      color: #8b5e3c;\n    }\n\n    .navbar-links a:hover::after {\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .hamburger {\n      display: none;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 5px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .hamburger span {\n      display: block;\n      width: 26px;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: #5a4a42;\n      transition: all 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(1) {\n      transform: rotate(45deg) translate(5px, 5px);\n    }\n\n    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(2) {\n      opacity: 0;\n    }\n\n    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(3) {\n      transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(5px, -5px);\n    }\n\n    /* ===== HERO ===== */\n    .hero {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(210, 170, 120, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 50%, rgba(180, 130, 80, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%),\n        linear-gradient(180deg, #fdfaf6 0%, #f5efe6 100%);\n    }\n\n    .hero-ornament {\n      width: 120px;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #c9a87c, transparent);\n      margin: 1.5rem auto;\n    }\n\n    .hero-icon {\n      width: 90px;\n      height: 90px;\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 {\n      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);\n      font-weight: normal;\n      color: #5a3e2b;\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 span {\n      display: block;\n      font-size: 0.45em;\n      letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: #8b5e3c;\n      margin-top: 0.5rem;\n      font-weight: normal;\n    }\n\n    .hero-tagline {\n      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.3rem);\n      color: #7a6655;\n      margin-top: 1.5rem;\n      font-style: italic;\n      max-width: 500px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-cta {\n      margin-top: 2.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;\n      border: 2px solid #8b5e3c;\n      color: #8b5e3c;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.3s;\n      background: transparent;\n    }\n\n    .btn:hover {\n      background: #8b5e3c;\n      color: #fdfaf6;\n    }\n\n    .btn-filled {\n      background: #8b5e3c;\n      color: #fdfaf6;\n    }\n\n    .btn-filled:hover {\n      background: #6f4b30;\n      border-color: #6f4b30;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */\n    .section {\n      padding: 5rem 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .section-inner {\n      max-width: 1100px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);\n      font-weight: normal;\n      color: #5a3e2b;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    }\n\n    .section-subtitle {\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #8b7b6e;\n      font-style: italic;\n      margin-bottom: 3rem;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    .section-divider {\n      width: 60px;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: #c9a87c;\n      margin: 1rem auto 0;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== ABOUT ===== */\n    .about {\n      background: #f5efe6;\n    }\n\n    .about-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 3rem;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .about-text p {\n      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: #5a4a42;\n    }\n\n    .about-image {\n      width: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8d5be 0%, #d4b896 50%, #c9a87c 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .about-image svg {\n      width: 60%;\n      height: 60%;\n      opacity: 0.35;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== MENU ===== */\n    .menu-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n      gap: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card {\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 2rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(59, 47, 47, 0.06);\n      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n      border: 1px solid #ede5d9;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-4px);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 47, 47, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .menu-card-icon {\n      width: 50px;\n      height: 50px;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card h3 {\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      color: #5a3e2b;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card-desc {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #8b7b6e;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card-price {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      color: #8b5e3c;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    }\n\n    .menu-card-price small {\n      font-size: 0.7em;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      color: #a09080;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== HOURS ===== */\n    .hours {\n      background: #f5efe6;\n    }\n\n    .hours-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 3rem;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table tr {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0d5c8;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table tr:last-child {\n      border-bottom: none;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table td {\n      padding: 1rem 0;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table td:first-child {\n      color: #5a4a42;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table td:last-child {\n      text-align: right;\n      color: #7a6655;\n    }\n\n    .hours-table tr.closed td:last-child {\n      color: #b07060;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n\n    .hours-note {\n      margin-top: 1.5rem;\n      padding: 1.2rem;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border-left: 3px solid #c9a87c;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #7a6655;\n    }\n\n    .hours-map {\n      width: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 1;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8ddd0 0%, #d4c8b8 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(59, 47, 47, 0.06);\n      border: 1px solid #ede5d9;\n    }\n\n    .hours-map svg {\n      width: 60px;\n      height: 60px;\n      opacity: 0.5;\n    }\n\n    .hours-map p {\n      color: #8b7b6e;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .hours-map .address {\n      font-style: normal;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      color: #5a4a42;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== CONTACT ===== */\n    .contact-form-wrapper {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .form-group label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n      color: #5a4a42;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    }\n\n    .form-group input,\n    .form-group textarea {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;\n      border: 1px solid #d4c8b8;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: #3b2f2f;\n      background: #fff;\n      transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    .form-group input:focus,\n    .form-group textarea:focus {\n      border-color: #8b5e3c;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(139, 94, 60, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .form-group textarea {\n      resize: vertical;\n      min-height: 140px;\n    }\n\n    .form-submit {\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .form-submit .btn {\n      min-width: 200px;\n    }\n\n    /* Thank-you message */\n    .thank-you {\n      display: none;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 3rem 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .thank-you.show {\n      display: block;\n      animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease;\n    }\n\n    .thank-you-icon {\n      width: 70px;\n      height: 70px;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .thank-you h3 {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      color: #5a3e2b;\n      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;\n    }\n\n    .thank-you p {\n      color: #7a6655;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== FOOTER ===== */\n    .footer {\n      background: #3b2f2f;\n      color: #c9b8a8;\n      padding: 3rem 2rem;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .footer-brand {\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      color: #e8d5be;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .footer p {\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n    }\n\n    .footer-divider {\n      width: 40px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #5a4a42;\n      margin: 1.5rem auto;\n    }\n\n    .footer-copy {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: #8b7b6e;\n    }\n\n    /* ===== ANIMATIONS ===== */\n    @keyframes fadeInUp {\n      from {\n        opacity: 0;\n        transform: translateY(20px);\n      }\n      to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: translateY(0);\n      }\n    }\n\n    .fade-in {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(30px);\n      transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;\n    }\n\n    .fade-in.visible {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n\n    /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .navbar-links {\n        position: fixed;\n        top: 0;\n        right: -100%;\n        width: 70%;\n        max-width: 300px;\n        height: 100vh;\n        background: #fdfaf6;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        padding: 5rem 2rem 2rem;\n        gap: 1.5rem;\n        box-shadow: -4px 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        transition: right 0.3s ease;\n      }\n\n      .navbar-links.open {\n        right: 0;\n      }\n\n      .hamburger {\n        display: flex;\n        z-index: 1001;\n      }\n\n      .hero {\n        padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem;\n        min-height: 90vh;\n      }\n\n      .section {\n        padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;\n      }\n\n      .about-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 2rem;\n      }\n\n      .about-image {\n        order: -1;\n      }\n\n      .menu-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n\n      .hours-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 2rem;\n      }\n\n      .hours-map {\n        aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n      .navbar-inner {\n        padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;\n      }\n\n      .hero h1 {\n        letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n      }\n\n      .menu-card {\n        padding: 1.5rem;\n      }\n\n      .section {\n        padding: 3rem 1.2rem;\n      }\n    }\n\n    /* Mobile nav overlay */\n    .nav-overlay {\n      display: none;\n      position: fixed;\n      inset: 0;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n      z-index: 999;\n    }\n\n    .nav-overlay.show {\n      display: block;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- ===== NAVBAR ===== -->\n  <nav class=\"navbar\" id=\"navbar\">\n    <div class=\"navbar-inner\">\n      <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"navbar-brand\">Le Petit Four</a>\n      <ul class=\"navbar-links\" id=\"navLinks\">\n        <li><a href=\"#about\" onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Notre Histoire</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#menu\" onclick=\"closeMenu()\">La Carte</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#hours\" onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Horaires</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#contact\" onclick=\"closeMenu()\">Contact</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"hamburger\" id=\"hamburger\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"toggleMenu()\">\n        <span></span>\n        <span></span>\n        <span></span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n  <div class=\"nav-overlay\" id=\"navOverlay\" onclick=\"closeMenu()\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n  <section class=\"hero\" id=\"hero\">\n    <svg class=\"hero-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n      <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"48\" stroke=\"#8b5e3c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M30 65 C30 40, 50 25, 50 25 C50 25, 70 40, 70 65 C70 72, 62 78, 50 78 C38 78, 30 72, 30 65Z\" fill=\"#c9a87c\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n      <path d=\"M35 62 C35 45, 50 33, 50 33 C50 33, 65 45, 65 62 C65 67, 59 72, 50 72 C41 72, 35 67, 35 62Z\" fill=\"#8b5e3c\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#5a3e2b\" opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      <path d=\"M46 30 Q50 18, 54 30\" stroke=\"#c9a87c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M42 35 Q50 22, 58 35\" stroke=\"#c9a87c\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <h1>\n      Le Petit Four\n      <span>Boulangerie Pâtisserie Artisanale</span>\n    </h1>\n    <div class=\"hero-ornament\"></div>\n    <p class=\"hero-tagline\">\n      Chaque matin, nos artisans façonnent avec passion des pains dorés et des douceurs qui font de chaque bouchée un moment de bonheur.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n      <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"btn\">Découvrir notre carte</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== ABOUT ===== -->\n  <section class=\"section about\" id=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"section-inner\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title fade-in\">Notre Histoire</h2>\n      <div class=\"section-divider fade-in\"></div>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle fade-in\">Depuis 1987, au cœur de Paris</p>\n      <div class=\"about-grid\">\n        <div class=\"about-text fade-in\">\n          <p>\n            Fondée en 1987 par Marie et Jean-Pierre Durand, <strong>Le Petit Four</strong> est né d'un rêve simple : offrir à ses clients des pains et des pâtisseries d'exception, faits main avec des ingrédients soigneusement sélectionnés.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            Aujourd'hui, c'est leur fille Éloïse qui perpétue la tradition familiale. Chaque recette est élaborée dans notre atelier, selon les savoir-faire transmis de génération en génération. Farine bio, beurre AOP, chocolat grand cru — rien n'est laissé au hasard.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            Notre engagement : <em>rien d'industriel, tout d'artisanal</em>. De la fermentation lente de nos pains au levain à la cuisson au feu de bois, chaque étape est maîtrisée pour vous offrir le meilleur.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"about-image fade-in\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 150\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <!-- Bakery illustration -->\n            <rect x=\"20\" y=\"60\" width=\"160\" height=\"80\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10 60 L100 10 L190 60\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <rect x=\"80\" y=\"90\" width=\"40\" height=\"50\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <rect x=\"30\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"25\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <rect x=\"140\" y=\"75\" width=\"30\" height=\"25\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#5a3e2b\" font-family=\"Georgia, serif\" font-style=\"italic\">Le Petit Four</text>\n            <!-- Smoke -->\n            <path d=\"M150 10 Q155 0, 150 -10\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M160 12 Q165 2, 160 -8\" stroke=\"#5a3e2b\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ===== MENU ===== -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"menu\">\n    <div class=\"section-inner\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title fade-in\">La Carte</h2>\n      <div class=\"section-divider fade-in\"></div>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle fade-in\">Nos créations artisanales</p>\n      <div class=\"menu-grid\">\n\n        <!-- Product 1 -->\n        <div class=\"menu-card fade-in\">\n          <svg class=\"menu-card-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" fill=\"none\">\n            <ellipse cx=\"25\" cy=\"32\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#c9a87c\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n            <ellipse cx=\"25\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#d4b896\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n            <path d=\"M12 28 Q18 15, 25 12 Q32 15, 38 28\" stroke=\"#8b5e3c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <h3>Pain au Levain</h3>\n          <p class=\"menu-card-desc\">Fermentation 48h, croûte croustillante mie alvéolée. Farine T110 bio.</p>\n          <span class=\"menu-card-price\">3,80 € <small>/ loaf</small></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Product 2 -->\n        <div class=\"menu-card fade-in\">\n          <svg class=\"menu-card-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" fill=\"none\">\n            <rect x=\"10\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#d4b896\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n            <rect x=\"12\" y=\"22\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c9a87c\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#8b5e3c\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n            <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#8b5e3c\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n            <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#8b5e3c\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <h3>Croissant au Beurre</h3>\n          <p class=\"menu-card-desc\">Beurre AOP Charente-Poitou, 7 feuilles pliées. Doré à la œuf frais.</p>\n          <span class=\"menu-card-price\">1,50 € <small>/ unit</small></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Product 3 -->\n        <div class=\"menu-card fade-in\">\n          <svg class=\"menu-card-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" fill=\"none\">\n            <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"28\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c9a87c\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"28\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d4b896\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"28\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5e3c\" opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"28\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#5a3e2b\" opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <h3>Tarte au Citron Meringuée</h3>\n          <p class=\"menu-card-desc\">Sablé beurre, crème citron yuzu, meringue italienne torchée.</p>\n          <span class=\"menu-card-price\">4,20 € <small>/ unit</small></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Product 4 -->\n        <div class=\"menu-card fade-in\">\n          <svg class=\"menu-card-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" fill=\"none